        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Lessen</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Lessines, (Dutch: Lessen) municipality in the province of Hainaut, where during the First World War six issues of emergency notes (emergency money) were issued, two dated 25 November 1914, three undated and one valid until 31 December 1918.</skos:definition>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://wiki.muntenenpapiergeld.nl/index.php?title=Papiergeldplaatsen"/>
